flowchart TD
    accTitle: ImmersionCaption 0.5.0 caption publication policy
    accDescr: Current recognition events are aligned with consumed speech. Sentence punctuation takes priority, then actual finality, then eligible clause punctuation. Recognized text is displayed directly without a stability gate or inference queue.
    Event["Apple Speech event<br/>Cumulative Mandarin + request ID<br/>Actual finality + timings"]
    Active{"Current generation/request<br/>and session running?"}
    Ignore["Ignore stale/inactive event"]
    Align["On new ID, carry unfinished text<br/>Combine carry + hypothesis<br/>Align consumed position"]
    Sentence{"Sentence ending anywhere<br/>in remaining suffix?"}
    Whole["Choose first sentence ending<br/>Keep earlier commas + quotes"]
    Final{"Actual isFinal = true?"}
    Tail["Choose entire remaining tail"]
    Clause{"Comma / colon / semicolon<br/>at position 10 or later?"}
    Fragment["Choose first eligible clause<br/>Exclude numeric separators"]
    Wait["Retain unfinished text<br/>Wait for recognition update"]
    Commit["Advance consumed anchors<br/>Skip punctuation-only output<br/>Repeat for remaining suffix"]
    Publish["Publish recognized text directly<br/>History: newest 300 phrases<br/>Overlay: last phrase in event"]
    Expire["Hide overlay after 12 seconds<br/>Keep history until cleared / quit"]
    Note["No stability confirmation gate<br/>Punctuated partials commit immediately<br/>No correction of old captions"]
    Event --> Active
    Active -->|"No"| Ignore
    Active -->|"Yes"| Align --> Sentence
    Sentence -->|"Yes"| Whole --> Commit
    Sentence -->|"No"| Final
    Final -->|"Yes"| Tail --> Commit
    Final -->|"No"| Clause
    Clause -->|"Yes"| Fragment --> Commit
    Clause -->|"No"| Wait
    Commit -->|"Next suffix, if any"| Sentence
    Commit -->|"Collected phrases"| Publish --> Expire
    Align -.-> Note
    classDef input fill:#eaf2ff,stroke:#3b67b1,color:#172b4d
    classDef policy fill:#e8f5f1,stroke:#23836d,color:#153e35
    classDef output fill:#f2ecfc,stroke:#815bb3,color:#382254
    classDef warning fill:#fff1df,stroke:#b9822d,color:#513b16
    class Event,Active,Align input
    class Sentence,Whole,Final,Tail,Clause,Fragment,Commit policy
    class Publish,Expire output
    class Note warning
